      "name": "Materials Dielectric",
      "description": {
        "content": "Route providing computed dielectric data for a material following the             methodology discussed by [Petousis *et al.*](https://doi.org/10.1038/sdata.2016.134)             Note that dielectric data has not been calculated for all materials in the Materials             Project database. See the `DielectricDoc` schema for a full list of fields returned by this route.",
